# ============================================================================
# Build-context bloat measured inside the RUNNING prod image (2026-07-30)
# ============================================================================
# Everything below was shipping in the 1.62 GB
# `COPY --chown=scitex:scitex . .` layer (Dockerfile.prod:389).

# Agent git worktrees — ~175 sibling checkouts of this same repo.
# /app/.worktrees measured 437 MiB inside the running container, and
# `docker inspect` showed NO bind mount there, so it is baked into the layer.
.worktrees/

# Nested copies of the anchored rules above.
#
# .dockerignore patterns are CONTEXT-ROOT-ANCHORED: `node_modules/` matches
# ONLY ./node_modules, `SECRET/` only ./SECRET, `.env.*` only ./.env.<x>.
# Measured proof that this is not theoretical: /app/.worktrees/*/.env.example
# was PRESENT in the prod image despite the `.env.*` rule above. Nothing
# secret leaked only because no nested SECRET/ happened to be populated.
#
# These `**/` forms ADD the nested case the anchored rules structurally
# cannot cover. They do NOT replace them — do not delete the anchored
# `node_modules/` / `.venv/` rules above: Dockerfile.prod:383-386
# npm-installs into /app/node_modules immediately BEFORE `COPY . .`, so
# re-admitting a host-built (macOS/WSL) tree would overwrite the image's
# linux-built one and break the startup Vite build.
**/node_modules/
**/SECRET/
**/.env*

# Stale demo videos — 975 MB (706,773,544 B + 268,698,983 B) of untracked
# drift in the prod build checkout.
#
# EXACT PATHS ONLY. Never `*.mp4`, never `videos/`, never `**/*.mp4`.
# .gitignore:122 is `**/*.mp4` and the five LIVE landing demos
# (videos/landing/{console,hub,scholar,visualizer,writer}-demo.mp4) exist
# only as force-added exceptions. They are served through {% static %} from
# apps/infra/public_app/views/pages_data.py and
# templates/public_app/landing_partials/landing_demos.html, so a blanket rule
# here 404s the landing page and /demos/. Both directions are guarded by
# tests/develop/test_dockerignore_prod_build_context.py.
apps/infra/public_app/static/public_app/videos/orochi-demo-2026-04-09.mp4
apps/infra/public_app/static/public_app/videos/landing/orochi-demo.mp4
